menu "Travel"

    config TRAVEL_FAKE_MINUTES
        int "Ask about a journey this many minutes from now (development)"
        range 0 600
        default 0
        help
            For working on the panel rather than for using it. Anything above
            zero makes it ask about being somewhere that many minutes from now
            instead of about the next thing in the calendar, which is the only
            way to see a bus without waiting for the morning: OVapi reports
            what is running rather than a timetable, so a journey tomorrow has
            no buses to name yet.

endmenu
